{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a fantastical journey with Nipi, a curious dragon  trapped in a mysterious realm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After touching an ancient, glowing crystal deep within a forgotten temple, Nipi triggers a powerful curse and falls into an unknown world. Waking up with a broken wing and no way home, his only path forward is up \u2014 through the immense, enigmatic structure known as the <strong>Ancient Tree</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 Explore, Evolve, and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the  layers of the Ancient Tree in this <strong>3D platformer</strong> full of discovery, challenge, and mystery.<br>Uncover glowing crystals, solve ancient puzzles, and take on side quests to gain powerful new abilities that help you revisit and conquer previously unreachable areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroidvania-inspired progression</strong>: Unlock movement abilities that open up new paths in older zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic platforming</strong>: Navigate shifting, breakable, and hidden platforms in beautifully handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging collectibles</strong>: Gather orbs, solve puzzles, and complete quests to upgrade Nipi\u2019s powers and survive tougher challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive fantasy world</strong>: Discover a lush, vibrant forest filled with cryptic NPCs, ancient lore, and glowing mysteries.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2e Will You Break the Curse?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb. Adapt. Survive. The crystal holds the key to your escape \u2014 but only if you reach the top.<br><strong>Will Nipi ascend the Ancient Tree and break the curse? Or become just another lost soul within its tangled roots?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629810?t=1747422905","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629810/848e12a78f39f9c4e573ec0e21466ccb74d1e6ef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747422905","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629810/68fb83126e173c17a70a0989bf036ae4c658db27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747422905","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629810/68fb83126e173c17a70a0989bf036ae4c658db27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747422905","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3688450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a fantastical journey with Nipi, a curious dragon  trapped in a mysterious realm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After touching an ancient, glowing crystal deep within a forgotten temple, Nipi triggers a powerful curse and falls into an unknown world. Waking up with a broken wing and no way home, his only path forward is up \u2014 through the immense, enigmatic structure known as the <strong>Ancient Tree</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 Explore, Evolve, and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the  layers of the Ancient Tree in this <strong>3D platformer</strong> full of discovery, challenge, and mystery.<br>Uncover glowing crystals, solve ancient puzzles, and take on side quests to gain powerful new abilities that help you revisit and conquer previously unreachable areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroidvania-inspired progression</strong>: Unlock movement abilities that open up new paths in older zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic platforming</strong>: Navigate shifting, breakable, and hidden platforms in beautifully handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging collectibles</strong>: Gather orbs, solve puzzles, and complete quests to upgrade Nipi\u2019s powers and survive tougher challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive fantasy world</strong>: Discover a lush, vibrant forest filled with cryptic NPCs, ancient lore, and glowing mysteries.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2e Will You Break the Curse?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb. Adapt. Survive. The crystal holds the key to your escape \u2014 but only if you reach the top.<br><strong>Will Nipi ascend the Ancient Tree and break the curse? Or become just another lost soul within its tangled roots?</strong></p>","developers":["Sachimi Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629810/66aee2979873a313470312fe64cd43d70ff47a13/header.jpg?t=1747422905","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"TBD","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li